The '''Secretariat Council''' ({{lang-bl|Consejo de Secretaria}}), also known as the '''Executive Council''' ({{lang-bl|Consejo Ejecutivo}}) is the 24-member council that constitutes the ''de facto'' {{W|executive branch|executive}} of the [[Balisca|Baliscan Confederation]], empowered to act in the name of the [[Confederal Congress]] between sessions. 

